## ERA-5 COGNITIVE MODEL (replaces R2 tier model)

```yaml
era_5_separation:

  Brain_Zeus:
    role: stateless_reasoning_engine
    owns: base_gguf + cosda_lro (SKILL patterns, NOT live facts)
    does: HOW to think â€” ontology, reasoning chains, terminology
    does_NOT: hold memory, hold facts, make authority decisions

  SKB_Memory:
    role: live_knowledge_store
    owns: registry, runtime_state, actor_data, policy_snapshot
    does: WHAT is true now â€” dynamic, queryable, hot-updated
    does_NOT: teach reasoning patterns (that is LRO domain)

  Soul_Authority:
    role: identity_and_purpose_layer
    owns: values, charter, ARA, NKC conformance rules, mission
    does: WHY we act â€” authority boundary, purpose, governance
    does_NOT: store facts, do reasoning

  Coge_Router:
    role: edge_brain_protocol_adapter
    does: NIO->SIO, CAT parse, capacity estimate, SKB hydrate, route
    does_NOT: deep inference, hold memory, own policy

  CAT_Contract:
    role: executable_sio_action_unit
    format: AIL (.cat.ail) â€” Markdown + YAML
    does: describe one action for Human + Alliag + Runtime simultaneously

lro_skb_boundary_rule:
  lro_encodes: "skills (HOW to reason) â€” stable, changes yearly"
  skb_encodes: "facts (WHAT IS TRUE NOW) â€” live, changes daily"
  violation: "never train live facts into LoRA weights"
```

